  "content": "Cole three-putted 10 times in his last five rounds, and 8 of those came in two rounds on Oct 21. He took 165 putts over the five rounds (Sep 30 to Oct 21).\n\nNewest first:\n\n- **Oct 21, Springfield CC (tournament):** 73 (+1), 30 putts, 0 three-putts.\n- **Oct 21, Springfield CC (tournament):** 77 (+5), 37 putts, 3 three-putts. Putting cost him 6.64 strokes gained, and it was the main reason for the round.\n- **Oct 21, Springfield CC (tournament):** 74 (+2), 37 putts, 3 three-putts. He hit 16 of 18 greens but lost 3.9 strokes putting.\n- **Oct 6, Bryan Park Champs (practice):** 82 (+10), 31 putts, 2 three-putts. The damage came on approach, where he lost 7.13 strokes.\n- **Sep 30, Starmount Forest (practice):** 75 (+4), 30 putts, 2 three-putts. This was his one round with positive putting, at +0.76.\n\nThere were three tournament rounds on Oct 21, so I can't say from the data which was played first. His putt count doesn't track his scores in the practice rounds: 31 putts went with an 82, and 30 with a 75.",
